        "text": "Troubleshooting Your Nighthawk R7000 Disconnects",
        "variant": "h2"
      },
      "children": []
    },
    "intro_text": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Based on your description, the issue is likely related to the router's configuration, firmware, or a signal problem from your ISP. The amber internet light indicates the router is failing to acquire a valid IP address or connection from the modem. The following systematic guide will help you diagnose the root cause."
      },
      "children": []
    },
